{
  "title": "Help Our Students Get to China!",
  "date": "2026-08-27",
  "body": "Our Rosehill College students are fundraising for an exciting **learning journey to China in 2027**.\n\nThis trip will give students the chance to experience a new culture, explore new places, and take their learning beyond the classroom. Your support can help make this opportunity possible.\n\nEvery donation, big or small, makes a difference. If you are unable to donate, sharing the fundraiser with your whānau and friends is also a great way to support our students.\n\n[Support our students through Givealittle](https://givealittle.co.nz/cause/learning-beyond-the-classroom-rosehills-2027-china?fbclid=IwY2xjawUA505wZG9mBWV4dG4DYWVtAjEwAGJyaWQRMGdhRndTbWFZMkM0dzB1UGVzcnRjBmFwcF9pZBAyMjIwMzkxNzg4MjAwODkyAAEeqgTzCzvJ3OxRsf_j85oIg3mDa5Smp_ukEHUra3qVtDQt2lagY7Z8dRW2pdU_aem_NUbVmX8i6mjCRugHH6hLbg)\n\n<button style=\"background-color:#da2a2e; border: none; color: white; padding: 15px 32px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;\"><a href=\"https://givealittle.co.nz/cause/learning-beyond-the-classroom-rosehills-2027-china?fbclid=IwY2xjawUA505wZG9mBWV4dG4DYWVtAjEwAGJyaWQRMGdhRndTbWFZMkM0dzB1UGVzcnRjBmFwcF9pZBAyMjIwMzkxNzg4MjAwODkyAAEeqgTzCzvJ3OxRsf_j85oIg3mDa5Smp_ukEHUra3qVtDQt2lagY7Z8dRW2pdU_aem_NUbVmX8i6mjCRugHH6hLbg\">Support our students through Givealittle</a></button>\n\n\n\n**Thank you for getting behind our students and supporting their journey!**",
